# DigitalPulse

Follow `Docs/DigitalPulse_Architecture_Development_Master_Specification_v2.0.md`.

- Modular monolith: Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Api, Worker, Contracts, `web/digitalpulse-web`.
- TenantId is resolved from the authenticated session. Never trust client `TenantId` or `X-Tenant-Id` unless it matches the session.
- Auth UI talks only to `/v1/auth`. Do not hard-code users or tokens in components. Development JWT lives behind `IAuthTokenIssuer`.
- Subscription plans come from `ISubscriptionPlanCatalog` / SQL seed. Do not hard-code plan prices in feature logic.
- Isolation boundary is Tenant. Work object is Business. Agency clients are businesses under one Agency tenant.
- Every page: loading, empty, error, success, validation. Mobile-first. No fake production integrations.
